flowchart LR
    I[Change Intent\nintent + context + source commit] --> A[Acceptance results\nAC-01…AC-N]
    I --> C[Change list\nCH-01…CH-N]
    A --> E[Evidence artifacts\nlogs / diff / review]
    C --> E
    E --> B{Identity and\nbidirectional links OK?}
    B -->|否| X[BLOCKED\nmissing / mismatch / unlinked]
    B -->|是| R[Release approval\nowner + approval id]
    R --> G{Approved and\ncommit matches?}
    G -->|否| Y[BLOCKED\nrelease_not_approved]
    G -->|是| T[TRACEABLE\nhand to Verify / Release Gate]
